node laws | Environment laws | P⁰ and Pʲ | law of Rᵢ
node ratios | Likelihood ratios | one-dimensional | ratio samples
node mmd | Gaussian MMD | compare ratio laws | observable discrepancy
node graph | Discrepancy graph | draw j→i | changed law
node rank | Rank decoding | ancestral information | target permutation
edge laws -> ratios
edge ratios -> mmd
edge mmd -> graph
edge graph -> rank
